OL,3,GNEWSASecond 'football special' park and
OL,4,Aride confirmed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA second park and ride bus service
OL,7,Ftaking football supporters to games is
OL,8,Fdue to launch next month.
OL,10,FThe X40 service from Newcastle Great
OL,11,FPark to St James' Park was trialled at
OL,12,FNewcastle's Premier League fixture with
OL,13,FBrighton in May and had "positive
OL,14,Ffeedback" and "promising" passenger
OL,15,Fnumbers, according to the local
OL,16,Fcouncil.
OL,18,FAlthough not ready in time for Sunday's
OL,19,Fopening weekend clash with Liverpool,
OL,20,Fthe service will start properly when
OL,21,Fthe Magpies take on Bournemouth on 5
OL,22,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
