OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSASecond 'football special' park and
OL,4,Aride confirmed
OL,5,
OL,6,FNewcastle City Council has agreed to
OL,7,Fpay #72,000 to Go North East to operate
OL,8,Fthe service this season, while the
OL,9,Foriginal X50 "Soccerbus" from the
OL,10,FMetrocentre will also continue for the
OL,11,Fnext two years.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
